@startuml
title ufAIM - Alignment Semantics vs Metric Realization

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho


package "User / UX" {
  component "Alignment Editor" as AlignmentEditor
  component "Views / Render" as ViewsRender
  component "Import UI" as ImportUI
}

package "Alignment Semantics\nmetric independent" {
  component "Sparse Alignment" as SparseAlignment
  component "FixedElement\nkappa const" as FixedElement
  component "TransitionElement\nkappa(s)" as TransitionElement
  component "Switch / Turnout Logic" as SwitchLogic
  component "Stationing" as Stationing
}

package "Metric Realization Layer\noperator boundary" {
  interface "MetricSpace" as MetricSpace
  component "MetricContext" as MetricContext
}

package "Metric Backends" {
  component "EuclideanEngineeringMetric\nFAST DEFAULT" as EuclideanMetric
  component "ProjectionAwareMetric\nlater" as ProjectionAwareMetric
  component "EllipsoidMetric\nlater / experimental" as EllipsoidMetric
  component "OperatorBasedDiffGeo\nfuture" as DiffGeoMetric
}

package "Spatial / CRS / Geo" {
  component "Engineering CRS" as EngineeringCRS
  component "Projected CRS\nUTM / GK / DBRef" as ProjectedCRS
  component "Ellipsoid CRS\nWGS84 / ETRS89" as EllipsoidCRS
  component "CRS Transform Pipeline" as CRSPipeline
}

package "Render Space" {
  component "Floating Origin" as FloatingOrigin
  component "MapLibre" as MapLibre
  component "Three.js" as ThreeJS
}

AlignmentEditor --> SparseAlignment
ImportUI --> SparseAlignment

SparseAlignment --> FixedElement
SparseAlignment --> TransitionElement
SparseAlignment --> SwitchLogic
SparseAlignment --> Stationing

FixedElement ..> MetricSpace : no direct sqrt / atan2
TransitionElement ..> MetricSpace : pose integration
SwitchLogic ..> MetricSpace : shared local metric
Stationing ..> MetricSpace : length / projection

MetricSpace <|.. EuclideanMetric
MetricSpace <|.. ProjectionAwareMetric
MetricSpace <|.. EllipsoidMetric
MetricSpace <|.. DiffGeoMetric

MetricContext --> MetricSpace

EuclideanMetric --> EngineeringCRS
ProjectionAwareMetric --> ProjectedCRS
EllipsoidMetric --> EllipsoidCRS
DiffGeoMetric --> CRSPipeline

ViewsRender --> FloatingOrigin
ViewsRender --> MapLibre
ViewsRender --> ThreeJS

CRSPipeline --> FloatingOrigin
CRSPipeline --> MapLibre

note right of SparseAlignment
Alignment principle remains stable:

- straight = kappa 0
- arc = kappa const
- transition = kappa(s)
- switch geometry uses same semantics

But realization depends on MetricSpace.
end note

note right of EuclideanMetric
Current dominant mode.

Must remain:
- fast
- boring
- default
- no performance penalty
end note

note bottom of MetricSpace
This is the discipline boundary.

Alignment code asks operators.
It does not assume the metric directly.
end note

note bottom of EllipsoidCRS
A straight line in Engineering CRS
is generally not an ellipsoid geodesic.

This is not hidden.
It is declared by metric binding.
end note

@enduml
